  - m_Id: 20283397143896064
    m_Localized: Queen alert!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283431977590784
    m_Localized: How to move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283443461595136
    m_Localized: Swipe to move your King one square. Move onto an enemy to capture
      it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283410544697344
    m_Localized: "When a Pawn reaches the other end, it becomes a powerful Queen.
      Queens move in all directions \u2014 take it out first!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20284520999264256
    m_Localized: Item appeared!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283341154131968
    m_Localized: An item appears every 200 points. Up to 2 items can be on the board
      at once. Move onto one to restore your health!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283235780632576
    m_Localized: Enemy turns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283325597458432
    m_Localized: Some pieces move every turn, others rest every other turn. A sword
      icon means it will attack this turn!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283042519687168
    m_Localized: Combo bonus!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283224984494080
    m_Localized: Chain captures to boost your score multiplier. Capture within 5
      seconds to keep the combo going!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20287839469674496
    m_Localized: Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
